@startuml
!include style.iuml
start
:Read the user's request;
if (Asks for something we do not cover?) then (yes)
  :Refuse with a message;
  stop
endif
:Language model writes the rules (JSON);
:Validate the rules and add any\nobvious ones the model missed;
if (Task or language missing?) then (yes)
  :Ask a follow-up question;
  stop
endif
:Search the index with the user's words\n(filter keeps models with unknown data);
:Re-rank the results;
:Verify the first 100 models in code;
:Sort and keep the best 5;
if (Any model that does not fail?) then (no)
  if (A rule can be relaxed?) then (yes)
    :Offer to relax one rule;
  else (no)
    :Say nothing matches;
  endif
  stop
endif
:Add rights notes, code snippet,\nmemory estimate;
:Language model writes a short explanation;
:Show the table (banner if none is\nfully checked) and the explanation;
stop
@enduml
